  "status_note": "Every value is null because the anchor has not been measured yet. It can only be measured once the environment images are tagged and their digests are recorded in skillshift-envs/DIGESTS.json, because the whole point of the anchor is to say 'your deployment is not the deployment these numbers came from'. A placeholder number would be indistinguishable from a measured one. `skillshift calibrate` reports this state and exits 2 rather than certifying anything.",
